ble\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu 22.04\n\n### Issue description\n\nIf a direct child of a GraphNode is centered using anchor presets for instance, then, the interactions still happen where the node would be without this preset, but visually, the slot is correct. You can see an example here, the node is not connecting at the right place. This is not happening while the connection exists and the positioning changes, no, in this case, the positioning is not changing and I connect the node at runtime.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e6bf65e9-c909-4701-b94d-601049b34618)\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate two GraphNodes with minimum sizes, add a child to each of them, enable the slots, move the child on one of them using anchor presets and enabling expand.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[MRP.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18795992/MRP.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"